{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jeff the Skinner",
    "steam_appid": 3145930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Jeff is a bloodthirsty faceless terror who hunts bullies, and you are his next victim.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Jeff the skinner to death.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to the world of darkness and horror in the game &quot;Jeff the Skinner&quot;! Prepare yourself for an immersive and thrilling adventure inside an abandoned house, where you must find a way to escape from the merciless and terrifying Jeff.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Door Escape</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The main door is covered with different locks and now you have to search the house and find keys and other objects to unlock the door and escape this house.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Escape</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the house, there is a garage. In the garage, there is an old car. If you manage to start it and open the garage door you can escape that way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help your Friend and make choices.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your friend is trapped. Will you risk everything to save him, or leave him to face a grisly fate? The choice is yours, but remember \u2014 his life depends on it.&quot;<br><br>You can protect yourself from Jeff using one of the two different types of weapons you can find in the house. But it only stops him for a while. But it's worth it.<br><br>Jeff gives you five days in the house, but you can earn an extra day by doing something for him. If you fail to escape by the final day... well, you can probably guess what awaits you then.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Jeff is a bloodthirsty faceless terror who hunts bullies, and you are his next victim.</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Jeff the skinner to death.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/f36670df4c87bcacc97b7218df45eb25.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to the world of darkness and horror in the game &quot;Jeff the Skinner&quot;! Prepare yourself for an immersive and thrilling adventure inside an abandoned house, where you must find a way to escape from the merciless and terrifying Jeff.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Door Escape</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/003d771e7201f1413f14d9975cce433d.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The main door is covered with different locks and now you have to search the house and find keys and other objects to unlock the door and escape this house.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Escape</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/bbca9936f6cb91c39654da3cdee3b007.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the house, there is a garage. In the garage, there is an old car. If you manage to start it and open the garage door you can escape that way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help your Friend and make choices.</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.poster.avif?t=1742362298\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.webm?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145930/extras/66f563a9bc64f211656ad35f830fdf27.mp4?t=1742362298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your friend is trapped. Will you risk everything to save him, or leave him to face a grisly fate? The choice is yours, but remember \u2014 his life depends on it.&quot;<br><br>You can protect yourself from Jeff using one of the two different types of weapons you can find in the house. But it only stops him for a while. But it's worth it.<br><br>Jeff gives you five days in the house, but you can earn an extra day by doing something for him. If you fail to escape by the final day... well, you can probably guess what awaits you then.",
    "short_description": "You have to escape Jeff`s house.. You have five days. Jeff the skinner is a scary horror game where you must escape from a sinister Jeff. Test your wits, stealth, and survival skills in an intense, immersive experience. Navigate through a terrifying environment, feeling the suspense at every step.",
